# Optional: a GitHub fine-grained token with READ-ONLY public repo access.
# Without it the /api/github route still works (60 req/hr per IP, and the
# route caches for 30 min). With it: 5,000 req/hr, and private repos can be
# surfaced. Set it in the Vercel dashboard — never commit a real .env file.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
